# Module

## Package Script Set: Root Lifecycle

**Scripts:**

- Package Script: Dev
  - Purpose: Run development server
  - Command: `turbo run dev --ui tui`

- Package Script: Clean
  - Purpose: Clean build artifacts
  - Command: `turbo run build:clean`

- Package Script: Build
  - Purpose: Build all packages
  - Command: `turbo run build`

- Package Script: Build Meta
  - Purpose: Build meta layer
  - Command: `turbo run build:meta`

- Package Script: Lint
  - Purpose: Lint all packages
  - Command: `turbo run lint`

- Package Script: Lint Fix
  - Purpose: Fix lint issues
  - Command: `turbo run lint:fix`

- Package Script: Test
  - Purpose: Run all tests
  - Command: `turbo run test`

- Package Script: Ci
  - Purpose: Run CI pipeline
  - Command: `turbo run ci`
